# Frontend rules

- Vite `base` is `/opportunity_borad/` for GitHub Pages — never hardcode `/logo.png` roots.
- Use `asset('file.ext')` from `src/lib/assets.js` for `public/` assets.
- `BrowserRouter` must keep `basename={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}`.
- API base: `import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || '/api/v1'`.
- Prefer existing Tailwind brand tokens (`brand`, `accent`, `gold`) over new palettes.
